From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Playport <dev@playport.invalid>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:33:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: route iOS NSI reads to Wine NDIS and IP providers

Compile the existing nsiproxy providers into the unix archive, serve enumeration and keyed queries without a driver, and convert i386 callers through their owner-local guest window. Preserve wineserver TCP socket ownership and log only bounded table counts/status, never addresses.

Class: host-app
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-07-nsi-adapters.md
Offered-upstream: no; Playport one-process integration
